% F03-IOSB: DEFECT 3.  EVERY TERMINAL QIO PUT ITS IOSB AT TTCHAN+2, WHICH
% RAN 2 BYTES INTO NLEN, THE LENGTH OF A NAME (3F AS ASSEMBLED); WHAT IT
% HOLDS THEN DEPENDS ON THE TERMINAL'S LAST I/O.  THE PATCHED KERNEL USES
% ITS OWN CELL, TT_IOSB, SO NLEN STAYS BELOW 40.
HEX
"NLEN BELOW 40 " MSG NLEN @ 40 GT = CR
"AFTER OUTPUT  " MSG NLEN @ 40 GT = CR
